---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import ArrowLink from "../ui/ArrowLink.astro";
import texture from "../../assets/bangsal-nam-9HMGyZJfrk8-unsplash.jpg";
---

<section class="home-introduction relative bg-ink text-paper [&[data-intro-ready]_.intro-stage]:sticky [&[data-intro-ready]_.intro-stage]:top-0 [&[data-intro-ready]_.intro-stage]:[background:color-mix(in_srgb,var(--color-ink)_calc(100%*var(--intro-shade,0)),var(--color-paper))] print:[&[data-intro-ready]_.intro-stage]:relative print:[&[data-intro-ready]_.intro-stage]:bg-paper" data-home-introduction aria-labelledby="home-intro-title">
  <div class="intro-stage relative grid h-[max(520px,100svh)] grid-rows-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] overflow-clip bg-paper min-[900px]:block min-[900px]:h-svh print:h-auto print:min-h-0">
    <h1 id="home-intro-title" class="intro-name relative z-3 m-0 px-6 pt-[clamp(112px,18svh,180px)] pb-10 font-display font-semibold text-[clamp(64px,18vw,140px)] leading-[.91] uppercase tracking-[-.035em] text-brick max-[900px]:[@media(max-height:600px)]:text-[clamp(48px,min(18vw,14svh),84px)] max-[900px]:[@media(max-height:600px)]:pt-24 max-[900px]:[@media(max-height:600px)]:pb-8 min-[900px]:absolute min-[900px]:left-[6.5%] min-[900px]:top-1/2 min-[900px]:[translate:0_-50%] min-[900px]:p-0 min-[900px]:text-[clamp(54px,10vw,184px)] min-[900px]:[@media(max-height:500px)]:text-[min(10vw,30svh)] in-data-intro-ready:opacity-(--intro-name-opacity,1) in-data-intro-ready:transform-[translateX(var(--intro-name-x,0px))] print:in-data-intro-ready:opacity-100 print:in-data-intro-ready:transform-none">
      <span class="intro-name-line block overflow-clip py-[.045em] [&_>_span]:block [&_>_span]:animate-[intro-name-enter_1100ms_cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)_both] [&+.intro-name-line_>_span]:[animation-delay:110ms] motion-reduce:[&_>_span]:animate-none"><span>Melvyn</span></span>
      <span class="intro-name-line block overflow-clip py-[.045em] [&_>_span]:block [&_>_span]:animate-[intro-name-enter_1100ms_cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)_both] [&+.intro-name-line_>_span]:[animation-delay:110ms] motion-reduce:[&_>_span]:animate-none"><span>Philippon</span></span>
    </h1>
    <figure class="intro-texture animate-[intro-photo-enter_1100ms_cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)_180ms_both] motion-reduce:animate-none min-[900px]:animate-none relative min-h-0 w-full h-full m-0 overflow-clip bg-brick [&_img]:block [&_img]:w-full [&_img]:h-full [&_img]:object-cover [&_img]:object-[50%_48%] min-[900px]:absolute min-[900px]:inset-0 min-[900px]:[translate:calc(50%*(1-var(--intro-slide,0)))_0] print:in-data-intro-ready:translate-0" aria-hidden="true">
      <Image src={texture} widths={[480, 720, 1440, 2400, 2848]} width={2400} sizes="100vw" format="webp" quality={85} alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
    </figure>
  </div>
  <div class="intro-zoom-space hidden in-data-intro-ready:block in-data-intro-ready:h-[140svh] print:in-data-intro-ready:hidden" data-intro-zoom-space aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <section class="intro-biography relative z-3 [background:var(--color-ink)] p-[clamp(100px,11vw,200px)_6.5%_clamp(100px,10vw,180px)] [&_h2]:max-w-310 [&_h2]:m-0 [&_h2]:[font:500_clamp(46px,6vw,110px)/1.05_var(--font-sans)] [&_h2]:tracking-[-.055em] [&_h2]:text-pretty max-[700px]:p-[90px_24px_100px] print:p-[40px_24px]" aria-labelledby="intro-biography-title">
    <h2 id="intro-biography-title" data-home-reveal class="[&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:opacity-0 [&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:transform-[translateY(36px)] [&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:[transition:opacity_900ms_ease,transform_1100ms_cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)] [&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready][data-reveal-ready='visible']]:opacity-100 [&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready][data-reveal-ready='visible']]:transform-none motion-reduce:[&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:opacity-100 motion-reduce:[&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:transform-none motion-reduce:[&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:[transition:none] print:[&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:opacity-100 print:[&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:transform-none">Qui suis-je ?</h2>
    <div class="intro-biography-copy w-[43%] m-[clamp(90px,10vw,180px)_7%_0_auto] text-soft text-[clamp(16px,1.3vw,24px)] leading-[1.55] tracking-[-.035em] [&_p+p]:mt-7.5 max-[700px]:w-full max-[700px]:max-w-110 max-[700px]:m-[70px_0_0_auto] print:w-full print:mt-10">
      <p data-home-reveal class="[&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:opacity-0 [&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:transform-[translateY(36px)] [&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:[transition:opacity_900ms_ease,transform_1100ms_cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)] [&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready][data-reveal-ready='visible']]:opacity-100 [&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready][data-reveal-ready='visible']]:transform-none motion-reduce:[&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:opacity-100 motion-reduce:[&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:transform-none motion-reduce:[&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:[transition:none] print:[&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:opacity-100 print:[&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:transform-none">Je m’appelle Melvyn Philippon, j’ai 20 ans et je suis étudiant en deuxième année de BUT MMI, parcours Création numérique, à Montbéliard. Curieux et persévérant, j’aime explorer de nouvelles idées et prendre le temps de les développer.</p>
      <p data-home-reveal class="[&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:opacity-0 [&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:transform-[translateY(36px)] [&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:[transition:opacity_900ms_ease,transform_1100ms_cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)] [&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready][data-reveal-ready='visible']]:opacity-100 [&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready][data-reveal-ready='visible']]:transform-none motion-reduce:[&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:opacity-100 motion-reduce:[&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:transform-none motion-reduce:[&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:[transition:none] print:[&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:opacity-100 print:[&[data-home-reveal][data-reveal-ready]]:transform-none">Passionné par le dessin, l’animation et les univers fantastiques, je puise mon inspiration dans les mangas, les jeux vidéo et la mythologie. Ces centres d’intérêt nourrissent mon imagination et mon envie de créer des univers visuels personnels.</p>
      <div class="intro-about-action mt-11.5"><ArrowLink href="/a-propos/" label="En savoir plus" filled /></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</section>

<style is:global>
@keyframes intro-name-enter { from { transform: translateY(108%); } to { transform: translateY(0); } }
@keyframes intro-photo-enter { from { opacity: 0; clip-path: inset(12% 0 0); transform: translateY(24px); } to { opacity: 1; clip-path: inset(0); transform: translateY(0); } }
</style>
